Reading (D2): `install` and `add` with a name that is not a full name and not an alias read the short names of the command in one request, after the load of the project files and `config.toml` and the setting, before `FullName.read!`. A short name that matches one package goes on as the full name (not tested here: the run goes on to the closure query, held for question Q1, research/slice-206f-revert/held/).
